@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M01 — Explicit source application and separate publication
actor Owner as U
participant "Professional profile" as P
participant "Tailored resume" as R
participant "Published presentation" as V
note over U,V
Scope starts after a confirmed authorized source edit.
That edit alone changed neither resume nor live view.
end note
opt Owner chooses preview
 U -> R : Preview changes for this resume
 R -> P : Read permitted source context
 P --> R : Identified source differences
 R --> U : Preview; independent overrides identified
 opt Owner explicitly selects and applies
  U -> R : Apply selected changes and save
  R -> R : Check authority and current context
  alt Denied, stale, conflicting or unsuccessful
   R --> U : Actual denial/conflict/save failure; no success claim
  else Selected application confirmed
   R --> U : Updated intended draft; overrides preserved
   opt Owner separately confirms publication
    U -> V : Publish intended reviewed content
    V -> R : Evaluate intended content / current authority
    R --> V : Permitted content or rejection
    alt Publication confirmed
     V --> U : Intended effective publication
    else Denied or unsuccessful publication
     V --> U : Actual result; no false live-update claim
    end
   end
  end
 end
end
note over P,V
Other resumes and actual submitted material are not rewritten.
Publication is never inferred from preview or apply.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
